[[File:Skeletal Wyvern icon.png|left]]
'''Skeletal wyverns''' are [[Slayer monsters]] that require a [[Slayer]] level of 72 in order to be harmed. They are found at the end of the [[Asgarnian Ice Dungeon]]. There is a shortcut at the ladder to the Ice Dungeon leading to the skeletal wyverns requiring level 82 [[Agility]] (or level 77 Agility with a [[Summer pie]]). Like other [[wyverns]], they require an [[elemental shield]], [[mind shield]], [[dragonfire shield]], [[dragonfire ward]], or [[ancient wyvern shield]] to reduce damage from their [[Dragonfire#Icy breath|icy breath]]; however, it is not required to be slain. They are also the only monster that drop [[granite legs]].

Although [[Tarn]] in [[Tarn's diary|his diary]] writes that he believes skeletal wyverns are [[undead]], they are actually magically animated remains,{{CiteVideo|author=Old School RuneScape|title=Fossil Island Design Stream - OSRS|url=vZ7oG1IDz1w|timestamp=16:27|date=18 April 2017|site=YouTube|notes=|name=}} different from actual [[undead]] creatures. This means that the [[Salve amulet]] and its enchanted versions do '''not''' work against them. They originate from [[Fossil Island]], having escaped the island via magic.{{CiteVideo|author=Old School RuneScape|title=Fossil Island Design Stream - OSRS|url=vZ7oG1IDz1w|timestamp=16:08|date=18 April 2017|site=YouTube|notes=|name=}} Additionally, their bones radiate a very weak magical aura, and stay colder than room temperature.{{CiteNPC|npc=Natural historian|quote=Also the bones we have collected remain a little below room temperature wherever they are kept. They have also been shown to radiate a very weak magical aura.|loc=|notes=|name=}}

Skeletal wyverns are assigned by the [[Slayer master]]s [[Chaeldar]], [[Konar]], [[Nieve]], and [[Duradel|Duradel/Kuradal]]. Because an elemental shield or better is required to defend against their icy breath, they will '''only''' assign them if the player has completed the [[Elemental Workshop I]] [[quest]].{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1039948185337257989|date=12 September 2018|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/99294|archivedate=26 May 2020|quote=No, wyverns are not assigned unless one's done that quest.}}

Unlike the wyverns that reside within [[Fossil Island]], skeletal wyverns do '''not''' drop the [[wyvern visage]]; rather, they drop the [[draconic visage]]. Killing a wyvern is also a requirement for the [[Hard Falador Diary]].

