==Combat==
{{main|Skeletal Wyvern/Strategies}}
Skeletal wyverns have high [[Defence]], [[Attack]], and [[Hitpoints]], thus making them very challenging opponents. They have three attacks: Bite / Tail-lash, which are basic [[melee]] attacks fully blocked by [[Protect from Melee]], Iceball, which is a long range attack blocked by [[Protect from Missiles]], and Ice Breath, which can freeze players similar to the [[Ancient Magicks]]' [[ice spells]], with the addition of preventing the player from retaliating back for the duration of the freeze (though players may still eat food or drink potions while frozen). Players can pray [[Protect from Magic]] to reduce the max hit of ice breath to 20, or wield an [[Ancient wyvern shield|ancient]], [[mind shield|mind]], [[elemental shield|elemental]], or [[dragonfire shield]]/[[Dragonfire ward|ward]] to reduce the max hit to 10. The [[ancient wyvern shield]] also makes the player immune to the freezing effect of the icy breath. [[Armour]] does not affect the accuracy of the ice-breath attack; the ice-breath will hit through all types of armour.

Skeletal wyverns regenerate 1 health every 10 ticks,{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://x.com/JagexAsh/status/984895709261582337|date=13 April 2018|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/27963418|archivedate=27 October 2025|quote=+1 every 5 ticks for the list I gave you. Or +1 every 10 ticks for the skeletal wyverns.}} much faster than most monsters.

As the wyverns are [[Draconic (attribute)|draconic]] creatures, [[dragonbane weapons]] such as the [[dragon hunter lance]] (on the pound/swipe stance, as wyverns' stab Defence is rather high) and the [[dragon hunter crossbow]] are the best choices to kill them swiftly. They are one of the only monsters in the game vulnerable to both dragonbane weapons and dragonfire effects. A dragon hunter crossbow with enchanted dragonstone bolts can be extremely effective against them.

