==Trivia==
*The sound effects of their Ranged and breath attacks are similar to [[Ice Burst]].
*The various models used by skeletal wyverns is nearly, if not fully identical to their living counterparts; model one resembles a [[Spitting Wyvern]], model two resembles a [[Long-tailed Wyvern]], and model three resembles a [[Taloned Wyvern]]. Model four has a similar resemblance to the long-tailed wyvern, but the tail is different.
**This is because the skeletal wyverns are [[Fossil Island]] wyverns that escaped the island via magic.{{CiteVideo|author=Old School RuneScape|title=Fossil Island Design Stream - OSRS|url=vZ7oG1IDz1w|timestamp=16:08|date=18 April 2017|site=YouTube|notes=|name=}} This is also related to why they are not undead; they have been animated via magic.{{CiteVideo|author=Old School RuneScape|title=Fossil Island Design Stream - OSRS|url=vZ7oG1IDz1w|timestamp=16:27|date=18 April 2017|site=YouTube|notes=|name=}}
**This was always the original intent of [[Mod Maz]], who originally created skeletal wyverns and was the original designer of Fossil Island, having planned it many years before it was finally released.{{CiteVideo|author=Old School RuneScape|title=Fossil Island Design Stream - OSRS|url=vZ7oG1IDz1w|timestamp=16:37|date=18 April 2017|site=YouTube|notes=|name=}}

